Oreon kernel SRPM expects these files next to kernel.spec (same layout as before, without Fedora lookaside):

  kernel-abi-stablelists-7.0.0.tar.xz
  kernel-kabi-dw-7.0.0.tar.xz

If you do not have them yet, obtain matching blobs from any prior SRPM or internal mirror, then commit them here. Bump %%kabiversion when you replace the files with a newer kABI set.
